;; expect: main.leak refused unchecked_proof
;; the hypothesis is the branch's — cited outside its dif it is nothing. The typed route refuses `h`
;; as unknown_constant; the body is then read by the classifier alone, which passes a proof over
;; unread and so takes none that the typed route has not read: `(Fin.mk i h)` is refused
;; (unchecked_proof), the typed route's reason carried in the message
(fn leak ((n Nat) (i Nat)) (Option (Fin n)) (if (< i n) (Option.some (Fin.mk i h)) Option.none))
